      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just a thought: would it be better to panic in the non-safe case here (instead of continuing running as if nothing happened and just printing an error which is not printed in non-debug mode anyway)? That, for instance, would mitigate that MSR_KERNEL_GS_BASE attack scenario?\n\nUnlike the host kernel, pKVM is only supposed to non-safely access a known limited set of MSRs, I suppose?",
